   371           * a base class that lacks the capability of actually building TLVRecord objects and also cannot be instantiated. The
   372           * reason for that is that different protocols build TLV records in different ways, so these missing capabilities will
   373           * be implemented by the derived classes which are specific to each protocol. This class only provides the common
   374           * infrastructure that will be used by them
